Welcome to my profile!

I am currently a PhD student at the University of Miami in the Biomedical Engineering Department focusing on immunoengineering applications in Type 1 Diabetes. I am studying under Dr. Alice Tomei and my primary intersts are on bioinformatics approaches for analysis of complex
high dimensional dataset. In addition to this I am validating unconventional CRISPR Cas-9 platforms for gene expression tuning for use in mechanistic studies of cell-cell interactions and eventual deployment in therapeutic contexts. 
